## Reproduced historical material — copyright as-is

This repository reproduces, for scholarship and preservation:

1. Correspondence and an engineering report from 1958 (John E. Dube / Alco Valve
   Company; Walter and Lao Russell), as reprinted in *Fulcrum: The Science Journal
   of the University of Science and Philosophy*, Vol. 4 No. 3 (October 1996) and
   Vol. 5 No. 1 (May 1997).
2. Page scans of those two *Fulcrum* issues (sources/), recovered from Internet
   Archive Wayback captures of philosophy.org (capture 20240922235101).

The University of Science and Philosophy (USP) published *Fulcrum* and distributed
all 21 issues as free downloadable PDFs on its own website for years, with the
stated editorial purpose of setting the historical record straight and assisting
researchers. This project republishes the two issues relevant to the 1958 coil test
in that same spirit, with full attribution, and claims no copyright over them.

No license is granted or implied for the reproduced historical material beyond
what its own status allows. Copyright holders with concerns may open an issue in
this repository.
